Don't miss these special workshop prices for the Bassidi Kone World Music Tour! For the month of May only all workshop tickets will be $25.00.  Workshop locations listed below. Saturday 28th June @ SOLBAR 12-1.30PM Sunshine Coast Sunday 29th June @ Kurilpa Hall 1-3-3.30pm & 3-4.30pm Brisbane Saturday 5th July @ Kulchajam 11-12.30pm Byron Bay Saturday 5th July @ Fradgley Hall 2.30-4pm Gold Coast Booking can be made [here](/african-drum-sale/ "Bassidi Kone workshops")

